    "created_at": "2016-05-17T18:24:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-17T18:24:09Z",
    "body": "So, if they are same-origin, that step (step 2) does not apply. But the question you're worried about is covered in step 4:\n\n> If the prompt to unload a document algorithm is being run for the active document of browsingContext, then abort these steps without affecting the prompt to unload a document algorithm.\n\nIf you got past step 2 and step 3 (i.e., the navigation is same-origin, and not initiated by traversing the history) then step 4 will still definitely stop you in your tracks and prevent navigation.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
