    "updated_at": "2016-05-17T21:11:20Z",
    "body": "Right, so this is where I must be misunderstanding things. My understanding is that the prompt to unload a document algorithm only covers the beforeunload event, and not the unload event. For reference https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#prompt-to-unload-a-document only mentions firing the beforeunload event.\n",
