    "created_at": "2016-08-30T16:54:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-30T16:54:56Z",
    "body": "Here's an update of what we found. We ran an experiment to account for fragment navigations in the unload handler for the last 3 months, there were navigations reported on ~0.00001% of the clients reporting metrics.\n\nStarting with M54, Chromium will start disallowing all navigations during the unload event. It would be great to update the spec to simplify it, and fix the undefined behavior here.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
