    "updated_at": "2016-08-30T16:57:04Z",
    "body": "Great! I don't think there's any undefined behavior here, but we can make the normative change in the spec to align with Chrome's simpler and more conservative behavior. We'll also want to write web platform tests for this to ensure other browsers align---have you written any (in testharness.js format) already?\n\nI can work on this sometime in the next couple days.\n",
